# Libration core rule

Libration is a renderer-agnostic, longitude-first world time and global scene instrument.

Repository documentation is authoritative. Chat history is not. Start with `AGENTS.md` and `docs/STATE.md`. Do not invent or self-approve work.

Preserve: one canonical UTC instant per frame; display formatting must not mutate product time; no duplicate config sources of truth; `RenderPlan` as the rendering boundary; backends must not decide product behaviour.

Do not claim verification you did not perform. Do not broaden a task into unrelated refactors.
